WEBVTT

00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:15,470
My breast tumor seems to be a catchy more and more to the underside of my skin.

00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:24,590
The rock hard area is getting bigger slowly. I continue to be watchful that my body will try

00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:32,110
to expel it through the skin. Would the wound from this be even more traumatic than the wound from a

00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:47,550
mastectomy? The person asking this is considering a mastectomy because the tumor is coming closer and

00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:55,070
closer to the skin. So first of all, what's the worst thing that can happen? Or let's say this,

00:00:55,070 --> 00:01:03,310
what's worse in a breast cancer case? That the tumor is coming out and it's bulging through the

00:01:03,310 --> 00:01:10,510
skin more and more palpable and getting harder or that it's going back and attaching to the

00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:17,310
chest wall. The answer is it's worse if it's going back and attaching to the chest wall.

00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:29,790
So it is a better thing that it is coming out. However, to have the tumor break through the

00:01:29,790 --> 00:01:37,070
skin and weep and bleed, it's not going to just come out like this little golf ball and be done.

00:01:37,630 --> 00:01:45,550
So if you're considering allowing it to break through and come out and weep instead of getting

00:01:45,550 --> 00:01:55,790
a mastectomy, I guess I would influence you to consider a mastectomy because then you're going

00:01:55,790 --> 00:02:03,310
to remove the whole breast and you won't be dealing with it. You may have a more difficult time

00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:08,110
finding a surgeon to do some sort of mastectomy. If it breaks through the skin and starts weeping

00:02:08,110 --> 00:02:15,070
and bleeding and causing an anemia and having other issues, then you may not even be a candidate for

00:02:15,070 --> 00:02:24,750
surgery and that could cause other issues. So we've had multiple women that just refuse to do surgery

00:02:24,750 --> 00:02:29,390
and let it break through the skin and come out of the day, trying to treat it topically.

00:02:29,950 --> 00:02:36,350
And it can be very messy and make your life miserable for a very long time and then they finally

00:02:36,350 --> 00:02:41,950
decided to get a mastectomy and probably wish they would have made that decision earlier. So

00:02:41,950 --> 00:02:47,070
at least consider that if we want to have a deeper conversation, you can feel free to make it a point

